abstract: "Web viewer and technical results from the EEG NeuroAction pipeline for exploring BANDPOWER-derived EEG features, cleaning variants, motor-class models, and interactive visualizations. This repository archives published outputs from a Kaggle run; it does not include raw EEG or the computational pipeline source."
